  body: "<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>GAME CONCEPT</color></size>\nPHUC\n\n<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>STORY DEVELOPMENT</color></size>\nPHUC\n\n<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>PLAYER SYSTEM DEVELOPMENT</color></size>\nPHUC\n\n<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>ENEMY AI DEVELOPMENT</color></size>\nPHUC\n\n<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>COMBAT SYSTEM DEVELOPMENT</color></size>\nPHUC\n\n<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>GAMEPLAY SYSTEMS</color></size>\nPHUC\n\n<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>COMBAT SYSTEM</color></size>\nPHUC\n\n<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>PUZZLE SYSTEM</color></size>\nPHUC\n\n<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>UI / UX / VISUAL EFFECTS</color></size>\nPHUC\n\n<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>AUDIO</color></size>\nHOANG\n\n<size=74%><color=#DEBD82>TESTING & POLISH</color></size>\nHOANG"
  scroll: 1
